{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_29","type":"agent_message","text":"The review is now narrowed to three actionable issues: `yin/def` bindings are missed, AST application sites are ordered before operands, and mismatched oversized bytes can be decoded before `:max-bytes` is checked. The new regression tests cover the original three P1 themes, and the Dart import is consistent with the file’s byte type usage, but these edge cases remain uncovered."}}
